{
  "name": "team-xx · Hello webhook (example)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hello webhook (example)\nReceives a POST with a `name`, builds a greeting and sends it back as JSON. This is how your app talks to n8n.\n\n**Test:** `n8n_test_workflow` with `data: {\"name\": \"Max\"}`, or a POST to `<n8n>/webhook/<path>` with the body `{ \"name\": \"Max\" }`.\n\n**Before you import:** the workflow name starts with `team-xx` and the path of the node \"Webhook\" is `team-xx-hello`. Replace `team-xx` in both with your slot id from `team.md`, for example `team-07 · Hello webhook` and `team-07-hello`. The connection refuses workflow names without your slot id, and a webhook path can be active only once in the whole n8n.\n\n**For the app:** \"Allowed Origins (CORS)\" is `*`, and \"Respond\" answers with JSON.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "team-xx-hello",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "greeting",
              "value": "=Hello {{ $json.body.name || 'world' }}! Nice to see you at the TTF Hackathon.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
      "name": "Build greeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"message\": $json.greeting } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build greeting",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build greeting": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
